Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:41.41,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}One day the light of love burning in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.41,0:22:43.33,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}will transcend time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.33,0:22:47.40,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}and destroy one of this world's dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:51.04,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}as it spirals toward the apocalypse
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.04,0:22:53.89,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}What is it that you seek
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.89,0:22:57.46,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}now that you're done hesitating?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.46,0:23:02.52,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}Is there a glimpse of hope for tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.52,0:23:06.96,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,620)}beyond this greedy admiration?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.08,0:23:12.17,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}I want to be armed with the power
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.17,0:23:15.98,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}to shatter even the darkness in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.98,0:23:19.82,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}just like the ancient magic in my childhood dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.82,0:23:23.70,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the next time I see your innocent smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.70,0:23:27.49,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}In my trembling hands I hold
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.49,0:23:31.32,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the courage of a plucked flower
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.32,0:23:35.16,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}My feelings are all I can rely on;
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:39.03,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the prayer that awakens
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.03,0:23:46.73,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,1620)}the light
Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.42,0:00:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can really grant any wish, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:15.71,0:00:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, your prayer will be heard.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.09,0:00:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.36,0:00:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Do it.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:48.08,0:00:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now... just accept it.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:52.67,0:00:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:03.00,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.01,0:02:33.05,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 5,0:02:38.02,0:02:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:39.52,0:02:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't very ladylike of me.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:41.28,0:02:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Hitomi?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:42.84,0:02:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't get enough sleep?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:43.69,0:02:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was at the hospital and had to deal with the police until late.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:47.94,0:02:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Did you get in trouble?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:50.07,0:02:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They said I was sleepwalking or something.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:53.51,0:02:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oddly enough, there were a lot of people with the same symptoms,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:56.66,0:03:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and when I came to, they\N were all lying around me.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:00.07,0:03:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's up with that?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:01.79,0:03:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctors said it was called a \Ncollective hallucination or something.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:05.98,0:03:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go back for more\N tests after school today too.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.82,0:03:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bother...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:12.55,0:03:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've just taken the day off.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:15.55,0:03:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do that! That'd make it seem like I was actually sick,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:19.68,0:03:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and my family would get\N even more worried about me.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:22.61,0:03:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our honor student!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:24.56,0:03:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so tough!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:36.66,0:03:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've felt this good.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:39.08,0:03:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel wonderful!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:41.93,0:03:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}, aren't you scared?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:45.25,0:03:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Well, yeah, I am a bit scared,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:48.72,0:03:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but I took care of that witch\N pretty easily yesterday.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:51.59,0:03:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,When I think about how I might've lost my two best friends,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:59.27,0:04:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I find that a lot more scary.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:02.10,0:04:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So I mean, I guess I have more confidence?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:08.09,0:04:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just at ease.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:09.66,0:04:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a bit proud of myself too.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:12.99,0:04:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm flying high.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:17.52,0:04:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on Magical Girl Sayaka{**-chan}\Nto protect Mitakihara City!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:25.74,0:04:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So you don't regret anything at all?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:29.21,0:04:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess if I had to name one...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.84,0:04:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be the fact that\N I hesitated for so long.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:36.59,0:04:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had known, I would have become a magical girl sooner.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:42.38,0:04:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mami{**-san} and I had fought that witch \Ntogether, she might not have died.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.52,0:04:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:00.74,0:05:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Don't tell me you're thinking of something silly.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:04.84,0:05:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I should've...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:07.48,0:05:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying all of this now because I'm already a magical girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:10.63,0:05:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't know back then.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:13.40,0:05:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I was destined to become a magical girl from the start.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:17.70,0:05:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:20.52,0:05:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I found my wish.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:23.78,0:05:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Something that I wouldn't mind risking my life to fight for.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.40,0:05:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a little frustrated it \Ntook me so long to realize that.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:38.15,0:05:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you shouldn't feel guilty.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:41.34,0:05:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to turn into a\Nmagical girl if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:44.97,0:05:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple as that.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:47.52,0:05:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:50.91,0:05:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I've gotta get going.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:54.61,0:05:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Do you have something to do?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:56.94,0:05:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You could say that.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.93,0:06:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So they're not releasing you yet.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.07,0:06:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I still haven't completed the \Nrehabilitation for my legs.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:08.17,0:06:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to be able to walk freely first.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:11.44,0:06:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They say the recovery of\N my hand is a total mystery,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.83,0:06:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so they need to look at it more thoroughly.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:23.95,0:06:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling, though?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.17,0:06:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Is any other part of your body bothering you?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:28.71,0:06:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No. In fact, I feel so good, it's scary.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:32.18,0:06:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even starting to feel like the \Naccident was all just a bad dream.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:36.10,0:06:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me wonder why\NI'm in this bed to begin with.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:40.77,0:06:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a miracle, just like you told me.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:49.08,0:06:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:49.98,0:06:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I said a lot of mean things to you.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:53.76,0:06:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Being depressed was no excuse—
Dialogue: 5,0:06:56.08,0:06:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, you should be\N completely and totally happy.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:01.91,0:07:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't make a face like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.36,0:07:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:04.96,0:07:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All of this just doesn't feel real.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:06.87,0:07:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't blame you for that.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:11.61,0:07:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's about time.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.32,0:07:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyousuke, let's get a breath of fresh air.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:19.38,0:07:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we going to the roof?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.27,0:07:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:44.10,0:07:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you all...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:45.43,0:07:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have a real party\Nwhen you're released,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:48.52,0:07:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but since your hand healed\N faster than your legs...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:51.00,0:07:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Is that...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:52.87,0:07:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me to get rid of it,\N but I just couldn't.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:00.17,0:08:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:15.69,0:08:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on. Don't be scared.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:01.14,0:09:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mami{**-san},
Dialogue: 5,0:09:02.69,0:09:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}my wish came true.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.74,0:09:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will never regret it.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:12.12,0:09:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the happiest I have ever been!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:47.80,0:09:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the city's new magical girl, huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:52.16,0:09:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to start a fight with her?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:55.41,0:09:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It just looks too easy.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:56.91,0:09:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I could kill someone like her in a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:59.67,0:10:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Or what?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:03.49,0:10:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a problem with that?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.76,0:10:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It may not be as easy as you think.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.28,0:10:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another magical\Ngirl in this city, after all.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:13.57,0:10:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Who is it?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:16.02,0:10:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know either, really.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:18.27,0:10:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:19.43,0:10:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:20.82,0:10:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She became a magical girl after \Nmaking a contract with you, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:24.27,0:10:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In one sense, she did.\N In another, she didn't.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:28.03,0:10:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an extreme irregularity.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:30.70,0:10:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I can't predict her behavior.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:34.87,0:10:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds fun.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.04,0:10:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting too boring\N around here, anyway.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.37,0:10:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta shake things up once in a while.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.93,0:10:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:54.22,0:10:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um, about Sayaka{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:00.24,0:11:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She's very persistent,\N and can be kind of stubborn.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:04.45,0:11:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She also has a quick temper...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:07.59,0:11:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's a really nice person!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:09.94,0:11:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She's kind and courageous,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:12.06,0:11:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and she'll go to any\N length to help someone.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:14.76,0:11:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All fatal flaws for a magical girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.59,0:11:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is... Is that true?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.99,0:11:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Excessive kindness leads to weakness.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.08,0:11:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Reckless courage leads to carelessness.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:25.96,0:11:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's also no reward\N for dedication of any kind.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:30.56,0:11:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be a magical girl\N unless you understand that.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.72,0:11:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Tomoe Mami lost her life.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:40.22,0:11:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say it like that!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:44.32,0:11:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}'s saying that she'll be fine,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:49.08,0:11:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but when I think she might end up like Mami{**-san},
Dialogue: 5,0:11:53.68,0:11:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.17,0:11:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worried about\NMiki Sayaka, aren't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:01.15,0:12:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything for her anymore,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:06.10,0:12:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.37,0:12:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you be friends with Sayaka{**-chan}?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.91,0:12:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight her like you did with Mami{**-san}.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:14.84,0:12:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be much safer if you all \Nfight the witches together, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:27.89,0:12:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lie,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:30.24,0:12:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't want to make\Nany promises I can't keep.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:34.24,0:12:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So I want you to give up on Miki Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:42.33,0:12:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:44.21,0:12:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She shouldn't have\Nformed the contract.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:47.26,0:12:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is partially my fault too.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.27,0:12:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've kept a closer\Neye on her, as I did you.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:54.26,0:12:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So—
Dialogue: 5,0:12:55.38,0:12:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that I've taken responsibility,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:59.26,0:13:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I must tell you that it's a\Nmistake that cannot be undone.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:03.02,0:13:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be like trying to bring \Nsomeone back from the dead.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:08.07,0:13:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you become a magical girl,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:10.85,0:13:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no hope for salvation.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:13.54,0:13:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That contract takes away everything in exchange for a single hope.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:20.03,0:13:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you've given up too?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.23,0:13:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Given up on yourself\N and on all the other girls?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:28.59,0:13:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:30.75,0:13:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't make excuses\Nand say I'll try to atone.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.43,0:13:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I must continue with my struggle, \Nwith whatever sin I have to bear.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:44.31,0:13:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I've wasted your time.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.77,0:13:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.52,0:14:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you nervous?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.41,0:14:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kind of.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:06.92,0:14:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One mistake and I'm a goner.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:13.84,0:14:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:15.05,0:14:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}, are you going to...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:18.42,0:14:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep. I'm going on patrol\Nto search for evil witches!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:21.67,0:14:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what a hero does.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.95,0:14:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be okay by yourself?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:27.43,0:14:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:29.15,0:14:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{**-san} did this too.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:31.08,0:14:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm her successor, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:33.19,0:14:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:36.93,0:14:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and I know I'll just get in the way,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:39.95,0:14:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but could you take me with you—\Nat least until I become a burden?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:50.97,0:14:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you trying a little too hard?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:53.17,0:14:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:54.29,0:14:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't. I knew I'd get in your way.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:58.04,0:15:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:02.27,0:15:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can't you tell?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:03.70,0:15:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands have been\Nshaking this entire time.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.35,0:15:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic, huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.07,0:15:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a magical girl now, but I \Nkinda feel helpless by myself.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:13.35,0:15:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.01,0:15:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a burden.\N I'd love for you to come.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:17.95,0:15:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Having someone by my side \Nwould make me feel a lot better.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:21.84,0:15:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That alone makes me feel invincible.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:24.27,0:15:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.75,0:15:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:27.10,0:15:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So relax and just follow me.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:30.22,0:15:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go get those witches \Ntogether like we always have.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.98,0:15:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.49,0:15:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how dangerous this is, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:38.88,0:15:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stupid, so I might do something reckless if I'm by myself.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:43.42,0:15:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll be more careful just knowing you're by my side.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:48.11,0:15:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:49.19,0:15:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, so long as you have a plan, it's fine.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:52.36,0:15:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyubey...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:54.72,0:15:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have a plan too. Right, Madoka?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:59.11,0:16:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know how you want to protect Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:02.15,0:16:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With you there, we'll have an ace up\Nour sleeve in the worst case scenario.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:11.97,0:16:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:13.87,0:16:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You don't have to\N say anything right now.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:15.94,0:16:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure Sayaka\N will be against it too.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:19.32,0:16:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I'll be ready whenever\N you make up your mind.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:28.01,0:16:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.02,0:16:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.24,0:16:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This barrier was probably made by a familiar, not a witch.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.67,0:16:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The easier, the better.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:47.88,0:16:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a lot of experience.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:49.74,0:16:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.62,0:16:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:03.13,0:17:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:04.32,0:17:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting away!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:05.22,0:17:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:33.86,0:17:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, what are you two doing?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:40.04,0:17:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting away!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:43.42,0:17:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you tell? That's not\N a witch, it's a familiar.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:47.56,0:17:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't have a Grief Seed.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:49.89,0:17:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If you let it escape,\N someone's going to get killed!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:55.99,0:18:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to wait until it eats four or five people and becomes a witch.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:01.05,0:18:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, you'll be able\Nto get a Grief Seed from it.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:04.83,0:18:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to slaughter the chicken before it lays any eggs?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.41,0:18:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to just sit back and \Nwatch the witch kill everyone?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:15.00,0:18:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, newbie. I think you're\N getting this all wrong.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.94,0:18:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of the food chain?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:20.98,0:18:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you learned about it in school.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:23.55,0:18:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The witches eat the weak humans.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:25.85,0:18:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And we in turn eat those witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:29.30,0:18:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the natural order.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:31.99,0:18:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The weak have to\Ngive way to the strong.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.06,0:18:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:39.35,0:18:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't tell me.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:42.58,0:18:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a contract with him just to play out some ridiculous farce,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:48.60,0:18:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,like pretending to be a hero\N and rescuing people, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:52.77,0:18:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And what if I did?!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.98,0:19:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon. Give it up already.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.56,0:19:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It ticks me off when someone gets in my way to play out a joke.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:27.69,0:19:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.69,0:19:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph. Stupid rookie.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:31.98,0:19:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool your head a bit.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.31,0:19:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:41.22,0:19:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That should've been enough to put you in hospital for three months.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:44.96,0:19:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}'s okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:47.44,0:19:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She became a magical girl using a wish for healing, after all.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.07,0:19:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Her ability to recover\N from damage is exceptional.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.38,0:19:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd lose to you?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.18,0:20:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because people like you \Nare around that Mami{**-san}...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:02.66,0:20:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're annoying.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:04.94,0:20:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so freaking annoying!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:08.57,0:20:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you shouldn't even\N be talking to me that way.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:13.21,0:20:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You should respect your elders.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.96,0:20:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:21.37,0:20:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time to be\N jumping around, dummy!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:27.92,0:20:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.08,0:20:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, it's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:34.53,0:20:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're too dumb to understand words
Dialogue: 5,0:20:36.51,0:20:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and you don't get it when I beat you down...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.27,0:20:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to kill you!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:51.02,0:20:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:55.53,0:20:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.28,0:21:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:12.23,0:21:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?\NThere isn't a witch here...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:15.65,0:21:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do two people on the\N same side have to fight?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:18.68,0:21:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:20.30,0:21:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of them intend to back down.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:24.97,0:21:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Kyubey! Make them stop!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:27.68,0:21:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This shouldn't be happening!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.17,0:21:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:30.97,0:21:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you want to stop them by force...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:34.98,0:21:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like there aren't\Nany options on the table.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:38.78,0:21:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Only another magical girl can come between their battle.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:42.93,0:21:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have the capacity to do that, \Nif that's what you really wish.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:46.79,0:21:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:48.54,0:21:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I make a contract too...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:54.96,0:21:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:02.33,0:22:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.26,0:22:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:26.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:23:56.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:57.61,0:24:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}Sayaka{**-chan}, you became a \Nmagical girl to fight witches, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:24:02.55,0:24:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}That girl isn't a witch. \NShe's a magical girl like you!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:07.01,0:24:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}This is definitely wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.11,0:01:41.74,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I'll walk upon this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:43.75,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}and pierce this shadowy veil of unease,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:47.42,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}as many times as necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:08.82,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}with these unwavering feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:24.56,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}the beautiful blue sky will always be waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:06.68,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,0)}I'll never forget the promises we exchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:09.19,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I still see it when I close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.19,0:01:10.81,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I'll move forward as I cast off
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.81,0:01:14.69,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}this darkness engulfing me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.97,0:01:30.80,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,480)}How long will it be before
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:37.11,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I see that lost future again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:26.85,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}So I won't be afraid
